# curses, enemy conditions and enemy mods (no warcries, no links) and ShowAdvanceTools="true"
# append="true" destination="Aura" (Load: SetText, ParseBuffs, lastContent; SelByValue and the
# two check boxes; the replayed UI tail). The Party button shows the advanced edits, editAuras
# focused by the constructor's SelectControl (its height then follows bufferHeightLeft).
# Typing at the end of the auras, Ctrl+Z (PartyTab:Draw's undo of the focused edit), more
# typing, Rebuild All (every ParseBuffs again), then a pasted code imported with the button in
# append mode with destination Aura (the auras' text gains the code's Grace entry; the code's
# Curse section is skipped), Ctrl+S.
